  "239": {
    "inputs": {
      "PromptState": "{\"text\":\"Create a 12-second, vertical 9:16 cinematic anime video using the supplied storyboard sheet as the visual and continuity reference. Preserve the boy’s face, dark tousled hair, loose white shirt, dark trousers, meadow, flowers, distant hills, cloud shapes, and warm late-afternoon lighting. Keep the scene peaceful and natural, with realistic movement at normal speed.\\n\\n0–3 seconds, matching panel 1: Begin at the very long distance, looking across the flower-filled meadow toward the tiny resting boy. Slowly glide forward through the field as a light breeze ripples the grasses and flowers. Distant birds and soft wind are audible.\\n\\n3–6 seconds, matching panel 2: Continue the smooth approach into a wide view. The boy lies on his back with his hands behind his head, gazing up at the clouds. The camera moves lower through the foreground flowers; grass brushes and sways gently in the breeze.\\n\\n6–9 seconds, matching panel 3: Ease closer to a low medium view of the boy. He remains relaxed and still, breathing naturally, his hair and shirt shifting slightly in the wind. As the camera nears him, gradually soften and fade the distant environmental sounds.\\n\\n9–12 seconds, matching panel 4: Arrive beside him and settle into a close view. The distant ambience fades almost completely, leaving only the quiet nearby breeze and soft movement of grass. He gently closes his eyes, gives a subtle peaceful smile, and lets one hand rest in the flowers, visibly at ease in the meadow. Hold this calm composition to the end.\\n\\nUse a stable, gentle camera glide with no abrupt cuts or shake. Keep the boy’s anatomy and identity consistent, and preserve the meadow and horizon layout. No slow motion, added people or objects, dramatic action, text, or music that competes with the quiet ending.\",\"order\":\"mine\",\"sep\":\", \"}"
    },
    "class_type": "PixaromaPrompt",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "5 Prompt Pixaroma"
    }
  },
